0..77 Comment "// Transport back along `ua`: the cubical case table of Cohen, Coquand, Huber"
78..154 Comment "// and Mörtberg, _Cubical Type Theory: a constructive interpretation of the"
155..227 Comment "// univalence axiom_ (TYPES 2015, arXiv:1611.02108), § 4.5, read at the"
228..305 Comment "// universe. `back(ua(e))` is the transport of `here(a)` along `ua(e)` in `y."
306..376 Comment "// Path(Type, y, a)`, and transport along it applies the record\'s left"
